<title>India: Kashmir, Manipur and the Maoist belt: the situation</title>
<link>https://map.igred.org/crisis/india/</link>
<guid isPermaLink="false">igred-summary-india-2026-11-04T06:46:23.635Z</guid>
<pubDate>Wed, 04 Nov 2026 06:46:23 GMT</pubDate>
<description>&lt;p&gt;In Kashmir, authorities launched a terror-financing probe that led to searches of four locations, while a fire in Bemina destroyed 80 temporary shelters, killing two people. In Manipur, the chief minister warned armed groups that UAPA action will follow civilian violence and sought reports on groups linked to recent attacks, while the Supreme Court ordered the CBI to secure testimony from a third victim in a sexual-violence case. Amit Shah announced that Chhattisgarh is now naxal-free and poised for tourism growth. The UCDP recorded 437 battle-related deaths in 2024, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Frontline Magazine&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Northeast Live&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Organiser&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Free Press Kashmir&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Northeast Today&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMirgFBVV95cUxPS0UtRDdBUlNWRUVINWJwQzAwOWROTTlUcFFXby1kVkVIRFhPcG5TaXNFTml5VU1LdElQVU5RWWRSTE5ZdVFJc3BpZzl5V1psUEMtOUMxTm9iRkRKS0hXM2lrRDMxY2xJYzFpWE14MlZYbFVYUlpFREtlbmFzSklSRVRLM25nMHV1UVpjRXFXdUF2UDJJNHdnQktENERUN3JhWmpRWTdYeTFSZEhacUE?oc=5&quot;&gt;DD India&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;India Today NE&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiowFBVV95cUxNem1CQl9sZHVfemI3NTMyNDlNWDFBLUZ1eXVfc29TOUhkOFA5MEpIeVpnbS0tSGhoVUVhMEdzUmlXUXZxVzFTdXZMNkNQU2Nrd0tKdktMQ0J1WjJWUF9lWXdHYzNrT2VqQzh1UmloV3RPcmdIcXBndTlUWkl6aWJ5V0t3SFFndFY5R2FONHFKOTZjbEtjbm9sclA5NFJlQ0lDLUpJ?oc=5&quot;&gt;Kashmir Observer&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMihAFBVV95cUxNVzhiMFJQYU9IdXF4eUhCeTlIOUJfZVJIdU9lWnEwSEh1RWxmSVJ0V